-- title:
--   Lifting split normal-form structure constants along small extensions
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ be an algebraically closed field, $n$ a natural number, and $B$ an integrally closed domain that is a $K[X]$-algebra with a $K[X]$-basis $b_0,\dots,b_n$ such that $b_0=1$. Let $d_0,\dots,d_n$ be natural numbers with $d_0=0$ and $d_i\in\{1,2\}$ for $i\neq 0$, and assume the normal-form degree bound $\deg\big(b.\mathrm{repr}(b_ib_j)_k\big)\le d_i+d_j-d_k$ for all $i,j\neq 0$ and all $k$, together with splitting at infinity: there is a matrix $\tau$ over $K$ with unit determinant, $\tau_{j0}=1$ for all $j$, and $\tau_{ji}\tau_{ji'}=\sum_k \big(b.\mathrm{repr}(b_ib_{i'})_k\big)_{d_i+d_{i'}-d_k}\,\tau_{jk}$ for $i,i'\neq 0$. Let $\pi\colon A'\to A$ be a surjective ring homomorphism of commutative rings whose kernel is the principal ideal generated by some $\varepsilon\in A'$, and $\rho\colon A\to K$ a surjective ring homomorphism such that every $a\in A'$ with $\rho(\pi a)=0$ satisfies $\varepsilon a=0$ and is nilpotent. Let $\gamma_{ijk}\in A[X]$ satisfy $\gamma_{0jk}=\delta_{jk}$, $\gamma_{ijk}=\gamma_{jik}$, the associativity identities $\sum_k\gamma_{ijk}\gamma_{klm}=\sum_k\gamma_{jlk}\gamma_{ikm}$, the bounds $\deg\gamma_{ijk}\le d_i+d_j-d_k$ for $i,j\neq 0$, and $\rho_*\gamma_{ijk}=b.\mathrm{repr}(b_ib_j)_k$. Then there exist $\gamma'_{ijk}\in A'[X]$ with the same four properties (unitality, symmetry, associativity, the degree bounds) and with $\pi_*\gamma'_{ijk}=\gamma_{ijk}$ for all $i,j,k$.
--
--   This is the smoothness, in Schlessinger's sense, of the deformation functor of a split normal-form finite cover of the projective line: every normal-form family of commutative associative structure constants over $A$ lifts to one over $A'$ along a small extension $A'\to A$. It feeds the construction of lifts over Witt vectors in [`AlgebraicCurve.exists_wittVector_lift_of_normalFormOrder`](thm.html#AlgebraicCurve.exists_wittVector_lift_of_normalFormOrder).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AlgebraicCurve_exists_lift_normalForm_structureConstants_of_smallExtension.lean

import Mathlib

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
